{"key": "eval12:eval12@01cfbb1e713f-1c7e18597b|precise", "final": "WITH c AS (SELECT observstation, COUNT(*) AS cnt FROM telescopes GROUP BY observstation), t AS (SELECT CAST(SUM(cnt) AS REAL) AS total, COUNT(*) AS n FROM c), s AS (SELECT c.observstation, c.cnt, c.cnt / t.total AS share, (1.0 / t.n) AS avgshare FROM c, t) SELECT observstation, cnt AS telescope_count, share, share - avgshare AS diff_above_avg FROM s WHERE share > avgshare ORDER BY diff_above_avg DESC LIMIT 10", "turns": 1, "batch_size": 1, "model": "sonnet", "executes": true, "answer": [["Observatory-East Michael                                    ", 3, 0.003161222339304531, 0.002068326164441143], ["Observatory-New Michael                                     ", 3, 0.003161222339304531, 0.002068326164441143], ["Observatory-East Brett                                      ", 2, 0.002107481559536354, 0.001014585384672966], ["Observatory-East Jeffrey                                    ", 2, 0.002107481559536354, 0.001014585384672966], ["Observatory-East Kevin                                      ", 2, 0.002107481559536354, 0.001014585384672966], ["Observatory-East Samantha                                   ", 2, 0.002107481559536354, 0.001014585384672966], ["Observatory-Jamesberg                                       ", 2, 0.002107481559536354, 0.001014585384672966], ["Observatory-Juanville                                       ", 2, 0.002107481559536354, 0.001014585384672966], ["Observatory-Lake David                                      ", 2, 0.002107481559536354, 0.001014585384672966], ["Observatory-Lake Josephview                                 ", 2, 0.002107481559536354, 0.001014585384672966]], "rows_answer": 10}